<title>USA: Grand Prairie, Texas $3.200 mln won by First Tenn..</title>
<headline>Grand Prairie, Texas $3.200 mln won by First Tenn..</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Tennessee Bank said it won $3.200 million of Grand Prairie, Texas, combination tax and revenue limited tax certificates of obligation, Series 1997, with a true interest cost of 5.3536 percent.</p>
</text>
